E440   B0 07                  BCS   uq9   ;   the 1
E442   56 01        UQ3:      LSR   1,X   
E444   76 00                  ROR   0,X   
E446   4A                     LSR      
E447   90 F9                  BCC   uq3   
E449   60           UQ9:      RTS      
